  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Photo duotones were produced in Photoshop IV on a Macintosh computer. Type was set in Quark Express. Typefaces are ITC Blair and Gill Sans. Printing was done on a Heidelberg KORS offset press. The paper is Mohawk Superfine 100 lb. text"--Artist's statement.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A pop-up artist's book. Photographically illustrated cover sheets with letterpress and cut-out widows. An ironic change in the backing photographs, set-up by the narrative letterpress, is revealed as each page is opened further.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The five photographs used in the text and one additional photo are reproduced on cards inserted in a pocket inside the back cover. Each card bears historic/descriptive letterpress on the verso.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Edition limited to 500 copies, signed by the author/artist.</subfield>
  </datafield>
